00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.190
You're naïve!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:09.570
If you don't have the determination, then go back home!

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.900
Though I lost my self confidence...

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.520
Bonjour, Ichigo.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:18.040
I became partners with the Sweets Spirit, Vanilla.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:23.530
I'm determined to do my best and become a pâtissière.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:29.540
recipe 3

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:29.540
Rozen Candy Prince

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.890
Rozen Candy Prince.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:37.900
St. Marie is a school where pâtissiers and pâtissières go.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:43.020
That's why it'll be fine if I could make my favorite sweets everyday.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.490
I was naïve to think that!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.370
Then, this question...

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.550
Kashino and...

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:50.220
Yes.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.290
He's been called up.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.120
...and Amano.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:53.940
Y-Yes.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:00.170
Geez, I'm really bad at Mathematics.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:01.860
Eh!?

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.660
Kashino...

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.800
What is it, Amano?

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.620
No, it's nothing.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.870
I'm sorry... I don't know the answer.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:26.390
English is difficult enough for me; how will I be able to understand French.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.300
Très bien, Andou.

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.880
Well then, the transfer student Amano-san. Please read it out.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:34.900
Yes.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:41.480
"Bonjour! Comment allez vous?..."

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:41.480
"Hello! How do you do?..."

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.970
"On voit la tour..."

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.970
"We can see the tower..."

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:46.910
"...Effeil!"

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:46.910
"Eiffel tower!"

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.240
So I add this, right?

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.080
No, not that!

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.360
Open the windows quickly!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.990
Aaaw, I'm sorry!

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:13.700
Don't be. For you to do that much.

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:15.950
Adversely, it feels quite refreshing.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.110
How is that so!?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.820
Hey Amano! What are you doing!?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.440
I'm sorry...

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.550
I'm really completely useless.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.240
Don't let it bother you too much.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.060
There are days like that...

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:31.860
Is that true...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.960
stone statues

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.960
careful fragile items

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.960
whose rice!!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.960
Art Club

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.370
Of course. Besides...

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:41.310
Papa?

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.290
Hey! Are you listening, Ichigo-chan?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.760
What happened?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.740
I'm sorry. What is it?

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:52.650
Like I said, the teacher for the flower arrangement class next is Hanabusa-kun's mother!

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.480
Eh? Is that so!?

00:04:56.180 --> 00:05:00.320
When you all make sweets, what do you think of?

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.530
intelligence & beauty

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.530
Gifted with both

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.460
Umm, I...

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:11.390
The one who makes sweets enjoys the process, and those who eat them are happy. That'd be great.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.330
You're right. It's the same with flowers.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:23.050
If you enjoy making the arrangements, the flowers will shine vividly.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.120
And those who see it will be pleased.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.010
Is that so?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:34.020
intelligence & beauty

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:34.020
Gifted with both

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:33.220
So don't worry if you're good or bad at it, let's have fun arranging flowers.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.020
Yes!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:48.400
I've finally found the flowers I like, but what should I do with it?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:50.610
If I cut here...

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:54.910
Oh no, I've done it...

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.930
Oh no, it looks bad.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.250
What should I do?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.210
It reflects you, Rumi-san.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.880
Growing freely while achieving harmony.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.760
Thanks.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:16.210
You take flower arrangement lessons, right Rie-san?

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.310
As expected, it's very well done.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.260
Thank you very much.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:22.700
But don't be restricted by the basics.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.480
It'll be even better if you were to arrange according to your personality.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.620
Yes.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.700
Umm, is it really that weird?

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.710
Not at all, it's really interesting.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.210
Really?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.340
You made this flower arrangement while imagining...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.370
A cake.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.920
Because I love making cakes.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:53.090
I thought it'll be lovely if I arranged the flowers like a cake.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:57.760
Your happy feelings while making this is clearly projected.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.320
It's an excellent creation.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.130
Is that so?

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.510
Why is someone like Amano Ichigo praised?

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.730
So, you know...

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.740
Today's dinner is pot-au-feu.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.670
It's pot-au-feu, huh?

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:15.380
Mama...

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.430
Onee-chan!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.250
Eh, Natsume...

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.590
You forgot something!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.910
What is it?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.460
No, it's nothing.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.470
Besides, it's really tiring today.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.470
We still have French assignments to do.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.640
French assignments!?

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:40.850
French, French... Where's the dictionary?

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.950
Hanabusa-kun? What is he doing?

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.990
Found you Ichigo-chan!

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.650
Rumi-san!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.210
Don't be such a stranger.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:58.210
I'm really bad at French as well.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.330
Let's do our assignments together.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.000
Really? Thanks for the help!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:15.750
Female speech? Male speech? What exactly are they?

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.900
Ah, you can find it here.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.220
What, Rumi-san understands it perfectly.

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:23.940
What? Don't understand?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:27.530
You lied about being bad at French.

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:31.150
That was to help me, right?

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.790
That doesn't matter does it?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.870
Alright, Ichigo-chan, you answer the next question.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:38.490
Yeah.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.930
Thanks, Rumi-san.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.550
Are you studying right after assignments?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:56.920
I thought I should study on the sweets we're making tomorrow, since I came after everyone.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:58.130
Is that so?

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.040
But don't stay up too late.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.560
Yeah.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:08.570
For tomorrow, in order not to drag
everyone down, I have to study properly!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.730
Yes! Do your best, Ichigo.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.890
Tomorrow I must...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.460
To-mor-row...

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.800
No, no, Ichigo! Hey, Ichigo!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:27.640
Hey!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.920
Geez...

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.700
Why did I fall asleep!?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:46.640
I'm really an idiot!

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.500
You can't help it.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.530
You just enrolled here, there are many things that you're still not used to.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:57.130
Well then, we shall make choux cream today.

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:01.280
The recipe and the ingredients are written on the paper that has been distributed.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.280
So today's choux cream...

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.560
It seems a lot easier. Thank goodness.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.720
Why are you looking so relieved for?

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:08.080
The easier it seems, the harder it is to make.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.790
It'll be fine if I just do my best.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.720
Ichigo-chan, please turn on the switch for the oven.

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:18.360
Eh, now? But I haven't done anything yet.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.270
It's to ensure that the temperature is high.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:22.300
It takes time to raise the temperature.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.920
Amano-san, please melt the butter.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:26.470
Yes!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.960
No.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:35.000
Don't do anything, just let it melt on its own.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.700
Eh? Is that so?

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:39.480
Don't be a burden to us.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:40.260
I understand!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.910
Amano-san, it's melting.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.650
Damn it, what are you doing...

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.770
Were you really listening to the teacher!?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.030
Of course I did!

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:11.190
It looks delicious!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.370
Don't!!

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.690
No!!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.650
Ah? The choux is..

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:24.470
Are you a moron!?

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.670
Before the choux is baked, you cannot open the oven.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:28.500
It's the basics!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:33.090
Oh my, wasted all the princes' choux.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.490
You didn't have to say it like that, do you?

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:36.480
I'm sorry.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.060
I ruined the choux.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:41.460
Don't worry, there is still time.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:43.400
Let's do it once more.

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.600
Come on, let's do it.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.900
Everyone...

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:49.590
I'll bring the ingredients here.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.010
You just have to get flour.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:52.950
We still have enough of the rest.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:53.910
I understand!

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:03.080
It hurts!

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.730
Ichigo-chan!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.280
What are you doing!?

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.470
Amano-san, it's you again.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.240
I'm sorry.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.830
She's troublesome, that Amano-san.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.120
How did she get accepted by St. Marie like that?

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:18.750
Really.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.200
Do you want to attend St. Marie Academy?

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.460
How did she get accepted by St. Marie like that?

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:06.470
I transferred here hastily because of what Henri-sensei said.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.560
Ichigo, cheer up.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.680
It's usual to have failures, isn't it?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.350
I...

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.390
...may not belong here.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.100
Ichigo...

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:28.410
Taka-chan, Mi-chan... I wonder how everyone is doing?

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.870
It's almost done, Ichigo.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:39.020
The pot-au-feu that Mama made.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.250
I won't forgive you this time.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.250
Her father is referring to her playing with his paints.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:44.270
Which one?

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.340
The smell of the paint Papa used.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.240
You're the older sister, so let me have it!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.710
You're the younger sister, you should let me have it.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.040
The senseless quarrellings with Natsume.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.250
Everything seems to be so far away.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:15.460
This is... Mama's favorite tune.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.570
Yay!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.530
I want the shortcake!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.910
Mama, Papa, Natsume...

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.540
I want to see everyone.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.020
Ichigo...

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.530
Ichigo-chan.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:52.500
Here.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:55.950
Hanabusa-kun...

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:05.430
Thank you.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:12.350
Wow, this school has a lake too!

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:17.020
When you're feeling down, this is the best place to go.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:20.730
Eh? You have times when you're feeling down too?

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.330
Could it be possible that Hanabusa-kun is an...

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:28.930
Egoistic male!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.950
There is a really delicious smell...

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:38.000
It seems to be familiar though.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.200
What is it?

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.480
Come over here.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.630
Beautiful!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.540
These are of a pure strain of roses.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.840
Pure strain of roses?

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:58.070
Roses that don't need fertiliser and can grow in the wild.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:04.550
Although it's blooms are not as attractive as normal roses, it's fragrance is fabulous, right.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:08.160
Yeah, it's completely different.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:13.360
The Essential Rose Water Oria is made from wild roses.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.540
You know a lot.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.370
As expected of the son of a flower arrangement family.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.550
No.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:28.000
I learned it from my father, who is in horticulture.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.280
Your father is a horticulturist?

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.940
Eh? Flower arrangement and horticulture...

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.850
Is it possible that your parents met at...

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:45.260
Yes, in May at a rose garden.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:56.310
When the roses bloomed, they met for the first time.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:08.530
That's why even though I'm born in October, my name Satsuki is derived from the month of May.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.550
It's a memorable name based on months.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.550
Yeah.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:20.050
The smell of the roses can heal people's hearts and cheer them up.

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.770
Come, you should try it as well, Ichigo-chan.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:31.690
Somehow, I feel completely re-energized!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:35.400
Now, I'll go practice on making choux cream.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.410
Wait, I'll help out too.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:45.070
After I transferred, adapting to the new life has kept my hands full.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.710
Yes, just like that. It looks good.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:52.910
I had decided to enjoy making sweets to convey happiness to people who eat them.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:54.680
Before I realized, I had forgotten about it.

00:17:56.310 --> 00:18:01.640
Especially when things go wrong, all the more I must be joyful when making sweets.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.240
Alright, just a little longer.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.190
Come to think of it...

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.030
Hanabusa-kun, you said that you'll help out.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:15.530
Hanabusa-kun, didn't you come here to help?

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.380
Alright, alright.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.280
Hey.. what are you doing...

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.390
Ah, the choux's burning..

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:28.290
As if! It isn't getting burnt at all.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.300
Liar!

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:31.060
Ichigo.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.850
It's about time to cool down the custard cream.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:34.800
Ah, is that so?

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:40.510
Look at this, Vanilla!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.100
You did well!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.170
choux cream, completed!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.710
Hmm... I could do it, after all, huh.

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:01.950
No, it's not complete yet.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.230
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ichigo-chan.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:41.590
May Ichigo-chan's school life be like a garden of roses.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:50.970
Amazing, it's just like a rose garden.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.460
Thanks, Hanabusa-kun.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.490
Well then, let me clean up over there.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.740
I'll help out too.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.340
Now's the chance...

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.170
Please, go ahead.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:20.060
It seems such a waste to eat it.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.320
Ichigo-chan!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.240
You made some choux cream right?

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:24.870
Everyone...

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.270
You're amazing, Amano-san.

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.080
No, don't be fooled by the appearance.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.980
We have to taste it to judge.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.790
Well then, Itadakimasu!

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.500
No, I should be first.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.320
Did you take our words for real?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.220
Remember to leave some for Vanilla!

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:55.730
Grandma, before I realized, I had made many good friends.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:21:01.600
Rumi-san, Hanabusa-kun, Andou-kun and Kashi...

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:08.810
Anyway, I want to do my best and stay in St. Marie Academy no matter what happens.

